# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""EN -> HU copy for the hu/ pages, consumed by apply_hu_translations.py.

Same structure (and the same EN keys) as pl_translations.py:
TEXT     whole text nodes / attribute values / meta content -> Hungarian.
SNIPPETS raw HTML replacements for text split by inline tags, per page
         ("*" = every page, optional there).
JS       raw replacements inside scripts (UI strings, locales, formats).

Register: formal-neutral Hungarian. Impersonal or nominal constructions
by default, the formal "Ön" only where direct address is unavoidable,
nominal button labels where possible ("Feliratkozás"). Partner CTAs use
"Tovább: <Partner>" so no suffix has to agree with a brand name. Numbers
follow Hungarian conventions (space thousands, decimal comma, "83 868
USD"), dates are year-first ("2026. szept. 14."), and a noun after a
numeral stays singular ("26 ellenőrzött partner"). Tool product names
(Bitcoin Concierge, Stacking Strategist, Loan & Liquidity Copilot, Tax &
Inheritance Agent) stay English because their pages are English-only.
"""

